From: NEURAX-FX <234716687+NEURAX-FX@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] panvk/wsi: default to DRI3 dma-buf on kbase Xwayland

Let kbase use the existing standard DRI3 dma-buf path on Xwayland with
DRI3 and Present, without setting PANVK_KBASE_DRI3. Keep the CPU path on
other X servers and leave the Wayland default and raw-FD overrides alone.
PANVK_KBASE_DRI3=0 or MESA_VK_WSI_DEBUG=sw forces CPU presentation on X11.

Record the configured image type after initialization clears image_info,
so DRI3 images use pixmap presentation and the implicit-sync path.

Generated-by: LLM
